	(footprint "eurorack:Jack_3.5mm_Mono_Horizontal_Threaded"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "228e993b-b117-4f33-895b-3243fa898dae")
		(at 116.45 62.75 90)
		(descr "XKB PJ-3410 (LCSC C5146694) 3.5mm mono panel jack, VERTICAL PCB mount: nose points up (+Z), terminals exit the rear face down through the board. Plastic threaded nose M7.7x0.75 (panel hole >=7.8mm), nose 4.5mm + flange 2.0mm above the 13.0mm body; total height above board ~19.5mm. Body cross-section on board: 9.0 x 10.6mm. Pads from the LCSC/EasyEDA source footprint; datasheet PJ-341X. Pad map: T=terminal 5 (tip spring), S=terminal 4 (brass sleeve/barrel), TN=terminal 2 (tip NC throw), 3=terminal 3 (unused switch contact, leave floating). BENCH-VERIFY tip/sleeve on a sample before fab.")
